 ### Uniform Grid Resampling for AMR
 **Definition**: Resamples an AMR hierarchy onto a uniform grid at the finest resolution for parallel rendering [S2, unofficial].
-**Step**: Evenly subdivide the resulting grid. Render each part in parallel on a separate processor. Combine partial images using binary-swap composition [S2, unofficial].
